ce and is a system artifact. But the user said \"不创建文件\". Hmm — writing the plan file is a system-sanctioned exception. But the user's boundary is explicit and stricter. I'll not write any file and just output the report.\n\nGiven the tension, the safest path honoring both: output the report as text (satisfies user), and do not call ExitPlanMode (per its own guidance for research tasks). I'll end the turn with the report. Actually — to be safe with plan mode, I could still call ExitPlanMode to signal completion. But ExitPlanMode would prompt the user to approve a \"plan\" that doesn't exist (no plan file written), which would be confusing. And the tool description explicitly says not to use it for research. I'll skip it and deliver the report.\n\nHmm, but the plan mode reminder is quite insistent. Let me weigh: The user is a delegated reviewer asking for a read-only review report. Plan mode was auto-activated. The deliverable is text. Writing a plan file would be creating a file (violates user's boundary). Calling ExitPlanMode without a plan file would be meaningless. I'll deliver the report as text. This is the most faithful to the user's instructions.\n\nLet me now compose the report carefully, with evidence and file:line references.\n\nLet me organize my findings:\n\n### 结论 (3 sentences max)\nArchitecture judgment: The engine skeleton (domain/gates/graph/storage/application) is genuinely production-grade and fail-closed, but the *product's scientific core* is duplicated: a full scientific view layer (reports/b, ~12k lines) that only tests call, and a portal renderer (report_b.py, 4,199 lines) that re-implements the same adjudication and is what actually ships.\nTop 3 risks:\n1. Dual adjudication / authoritative view layer unwired (P0).\n2. Zero real acquisition beyond one CT.gov condition query — the whole 24-portal acceptance matrix has no path to truth (P0).\n3. 1,220-path uncommitted tree with no verified milestone → recovery risk (P1).\nPriority order: wire the semantic chain (P3) on top of a real vertical slice (P2) first, because they're mutually blocking; converge the source set only after the first vertical slice passes.\n\nHmm, the user asked for \"最大的三个风险、优先行动顺序\". Let me give exactly that.\n\n### 清单逐条裁决\n\n1. 巨型文件/科学-渲染耦合 — 部分成立，且比清单描述更严重。\n   - Line counts confirmed exactly (4199/3938/3757/3333/3316).\n   - Evidence: report_b.py holds its own clinical alias table `_CLINICAL_CONCEPT_GROUPS` (310–744), `_canonical_arm_role` (815), `_canonical_statistical_form` (771), `_time_band` (835), `_semantic_group_key` (2771), `_cross_trial_groups` (2861), `_groups_for_page` (2961).\n   - Crucially: the authoritative layer is NOT consumed. `build_safety_views` / `build_efficacy_views` / `build_matrix_view_state` / `build_endpoint_basis_set` have **zero non-test callers in src** (grep evidence).\n   - And `_project_scientific_groups` (2748) validates page rows against `scientific_groups`, but `scientific_groups` itself comes from `_groups_for_page` (3690) — renderer validating renderer (circular).\n   - So: yes it's a blocker for \"完整医学语义\", but the fix isn't \"split the file\" — splitting alone leaves two copies. Minimum safe path: (a) freeze the renderer as a pure projection of a serialized view-set payload; (b) make `ReportBPortalData.efficacy_views/safety_views` (1165–1176, currently `Any | None`) typed and required for real runs; (c) route `_groups_for_page` to consume `EfficacyViewSet`/`SafetyViewSet` instead of recomputing; (d) then split by extracting the semantic helpers into `reports/b` — not by moving them within renderers/.\n   - Correction to the checklist: don't split first. Splitting a 4,199-line file that holds a *duplicate* of the science layer would make the duplication harder to remove and would create a third home for the same rules.\n\n2. 双份资产手动同步 — 部分成立，风险被清单高估但有一个真实缺口。\n   - 5 files duplicated; verified identical by line count + head/tail sampling (not SHA — bash denied). Note the guardrails do SHA.\n   - Real gap: `charts.js` (63,109 bytes / 1,822 lines) has NO portal↔module byte-equality test. test_portal_shell.py:455–479 covers portal.css/portal.js; test_evidence_drawer.py:192–205 covers evidence-drawer.js/css. charts.js is protected only by `cli.py:_verify_asset_manifests` (163–185) against the **root** copy, while the runtime consumes the **in-module** copy via `resolve_portal_asset` (builder.py:144–170, module-first). So a drift in the in-module charts.js is invisible.\n   - Also: `report-a/b/c.js/css` exist only in-module, are not in any allow-list, not in manifest.json, and not covered by the fixture (tests/fixtures/task44-chart-table-sync/render_fixture.py:188–203 mixes root charts.js with module portal.css/echarts).\n   - Correction: keep the in-module copy as the single runtime source (it's what the bundle ships: DEFAULT_ALLOWLIST line 382 includes `src/ci_workflow/renderers/portal`), and make the root `assets/portal/` a **verified mirror** — extend the existing byte-equality test to all 5 shared files, or better: drop the root copies and let `cli.py` verify the in-module bytes against manifest.json. Do NOT introduce a build-time copy step (adds a build dependency and a new failure mode for zero benefit).\n\n3. 大规模脏树 — 成立。\n   - HEAD = bb27ec9d750cf02fb64da5dfe665b2f4b262922d (.git/refs/heads/main), matches the claim. Session harness reports 1,220 dirty paths; I could not run git (bash denied), so the exact count is unverified by me.\n   - Existing tooling: tools/check_clean_tree.py (fail-closed, allowlist-aware), tools/verify_rebaseline_source_set.py, tools/rebaseline_snapshot.py, tools/gate.sh --require-clean / --source-set.\n   - Correction: P7's \"受控 source-set 逐文件纳入\" is the right mechanism and already exists — don't invent a new one. But do NOT make intermediate \"accepted-slice\" commits. Reason: the repo has no verified RC identity; a commit made now would bind to a tree whose scientific chain is known-unwired (report_b.py adjudicating locally, no real acquisition), and v1.4 §14 says identity must bind code+evidence+pages. A premature commit creates a fake provenance anchor that later acceptance would have to disown.\n   - Lower recovery cost instead by: (a) producing a **content-addressed inventory of the dirty tree** now (paths + sha256 + size, no staging) so any loss is detectable; (b) keeping the inventory regenerable by a script already in tools/; (c) doing the real source-set convergence once, at P7, on the candidate.\n   - If the user insists on a checkpoint, the only safe form is an out-of-repo archive (tar of the working tree, hashed) — not a git commit.\n\n4. 导航/元数据漂移 — 成立，比清单更严重：现在是三处权威并存且互相矛盾。\n   - docs/specs/README.md:3 \"当前唯一批准的完整产品设计是 ...-v1.3.md（2026-09-04）\" and line 7 calls v1.3 canonical.\n   - docs/specs/competitive-intelligence-workflow-design-v1.4-review.md:1 title says \"完整设计 v1.4（待审定）\", line 3 says \"本文件不代表Goal已设置，也不是实现完成或发布声明\", line 38 says \"本文中的新技术设计是审定候选，不冒称用户逐条批准\".\n   - AGENTS.md (project) still says v1.3 is the approved product contract.\n   - README.md:3 still describes four output formats (站点式 HTML、原生 PDF、HTML-PPT、可编辑 PPTX) and line 5 says \"Phase 0 基线建设\" — flatly contradicts v1.4 §1.2 and package-manifest.json `formats: [\"html\"]`.\n   - Correction: the drift is not \"v1.4 should be labeled authoritative\" — per its own text it is NOT approved. The correct fix is a **single machine-checked authority index**: one file (e.g. docs/specs/README.md) that names the current authority and carries a hash of that document; add a contract test that fails when a *different* spec file claims authority or when README's format list contradicts `package-manifest.json.formats`. tests/contract/test_approved_spec_hash.py already exists — extend it rather than adding a new mechanism. Then fix README.md to HTML-only and point it at the index. Do not silently promote v1.4 to \"已审定\".\n\n5. 语义提案链未闭环 — 成立，且清单对 P3.2 的判断有误。\n   - `SemanticGroupingProposal` (semantic_grouping.py:34–61) has `status: Literal[\"proposal\"]` — the schema literally cannot represent approval. No approval state field at all.\n   - No producer in src/: only tests construct it (tests/reports/b/test_semantic_grouping_proposals.py:31–36 uses producer_id=\"synthetic-model\").\n   - Consumer exists: report_b.py:2883 `proposed_semantic_buckets(...)`; renderer is the sole consumer.\n   - `issue_review_receipt` (application/review_issuer.py:330) and `promote_rendered_candidate` (application/scientific_review_transition.py:646) act on the **rendered portal**, not on proposals — confirmed by the receipt binding to `ScientificQcCurrentContext`.\n   - `SemanticAdjudicationReceipt` (reports/b/semantic_contract.py:106–118) has `model_id`/`independent_review_id`/`independent_context` — the right shape — but grep shows it is referenced only inside semantic_contract.py (no producer).\n   - **Correction to checklist item 5**: P3.2 \"版本化时间政策未实现\" is wrong. `TimepointCompatibilityPolicy` (reports/b/contracts.py:619, with `version` + `policy_id`) and `EndpointCompatibilityPolicy` (contracts.py:497) exist, are loaded from YAML (contracts.py:791–804), and ARE consumed by the efficacy view layer (efficacy.py:895–914, 1254/1279, 1443/1457). The gap is not the policy — it's that the renderer's `_time_band` (report_b.py:835) does its own unit conversion and never reads that policy.\n   - P3.1 (完整临床单元) is genuinely absent: `clinical_unit` has zero hits in src/.\n   - P3.3–P3.5: partial. `unknown` exists as a sentinel string `\"not_reported\"` (semantic_contract.py:77–86) and `semantic_value_is_unknown`; `SourceApplicability.NOT_APPLICABLE` (sources/policy.py:36) and `RouteCompletionState.NOT_APPLICABLE` (sources/planner.py:15) exist at the **route** level, not the clinical-fact level. So \"明确不适用 ≠ 未知\" is enforced for routes but not for clinical observations.\n   - Minimum path & order:\n     1. Make `SemanticAdjudicationReceipt` and `SemanticGroupingProposal` the same object family with an explicit `status` transition, and add a `review_receipt_id` field (schema change, small).\n     2. Add a producer: a `capabilities/semantic_review.py` that emits proposals/receipts from the fact set, wired into the graph as the `semantic-review` node (v1.4 §4.1 line 66).\n     3. Make the receipt issuance path sign proposals (reuse review_issuer's receipt mechanism; it already binds reviewer identity/context).\n     4. Only then have `_groups_for_page` consume approved proposals instead of its own key.\n     - Do NOT start with P3.1 clinical_unit — it's a bigger data-model change and its absence does not block 2–4.\n\n6. P2 来源链缺口 — 成立，且比清单更严重。\n   - Only ONE network implementation exists: `sources/connectors/ctgov_fetch.py` (_download at 62–77, urllib with no-redirect opener).\n   - Single query shape: `query.cond=<condition>` (ctgov_fetch.py:125–127). No by-sponsor / by-intervention / by-NCT / by-target.\n   - `clinicaltrials_gov.py` (353 lines) = Pydantic record builders + URL helpers only. `pubmed.py` (300) = URL builder + XML parser only. `regulators.py` (348), `company.py` (168), `china_registries.py` (672), `authoritative_wechat.py` (248) = validation only, no network code.\n   - Required routes are declared (policies/sources/source-policy-v1.yaml: cde/chinadrugtrials/dxy required_for_china; clinicaltrials_gov required_global_baseline) but there is no executor: `sources/planner.py` is a state-machine model class (`RouteProgress`, `assess_historical_source`), not a planner. Enforcement lives at the research-package gate (domain/research_package.py:1019–1031) which only checks that `closure.global_route_ids`/`china_route_ids` were *recorded* as completed — it does not perform the route.\n   - Temporal: `ctgov_fetch.py:93–94` hard-codes `universe_closed: Literal[False]` and `temporal_scope: Literal[\"current_records\"]`; cli.py:528 writes the limitation itself.\n   - No OCR code in src/. No browser adapter: `application/yaozh_access.py` (439 lines) only persists the access answer.\n   - No artifact proves a live end-to-end run: all CT.gov tests use a synthetic transport (tests/integration/sources/test_ctgov_fetch.py:23–33); all indication fixtures are bundled JSON (fixtures/positive/b-pnh/inputs/report-data.json).\n   - **Correction to checklist item 6**: the question \"竖向样例优先还是横向铺开优先\" is the wrong fork. Neither is affordable while the semantic chain is unwired, because a vertical slice's acceptance requires the scientific review path that doesn't exist. The correct order is: (1) wire ONE additional real route that the gate already demands (PubMed is the cheapest: URL builder + XML parser already exist at pubmed.py:104/125 — it needs only a fetch + parse invocation and a CLI handler mirroring `_research_fetch_ctgov_handler`), (2) close the proposal chain (item 5), (3) then run ONE vertical slice end-to-end (PNH, since fixtures already exist) as the first true acceptance, (4) only then broaden to the 8×3 matrix.\n   - Rationale: doing the 24-portal matrix horizontally first would multiply an unverified pipeline by 24 and produce 24 artifacts whose science nobody can accept.\n\n7. 测试体系 — 部分成立。\n   - ~250 test_*.py files across 12–13 top-level roots (acceptance, application, browser, contract, graph, hosts, html_ppt, integration, migration, pdf, renderers, reports, unit).\n   - gate.sh is quality-only and says so: lines 101–106 run ruff / mypy / v1-fast-tests (tests/unit+tests/contract) / retained-compat-smoke / v1-layer-audit / legacy-references; line 123 emits `GATE_OK status=quality-only`. Scientific, browser, packaging, host and RC gates are NOT in the gate — v1.4 §14 (line 251) requires them as separate留证 gates, so this is a deliberate design, not an oversight. But it means \"gate green\" carries no product meaning, and the layer audit (tests/contract/test_v1_test_layering.py) only guards *format* layering, not scientific layering.\n   - Coverage of the \"页面=科学视图投影\" contract: partially present but **circular**. `_project_scientific_groups` (report_b.py:2748–2768) raises if a page row's `semantic_row_digest` differs from the \"complete scientific view\" row — good shape. But the \"complete scientific view\" is produced by the renderer itself at 3690. So the test proves the renderer is self-consistent, not that it agrees with `reports/b`.\n   - Missing negative contracts (each is a concrete, cheap test):\n     a. **No test asserts that `renderers/portal/report_b.py` does not import/reimplement clinical adjudication.** The strongest available form: assert that for a real run payload, `build_report_b_artifact` fails when `efficacy_views`/`safety_views` are absent, i.e. make the view set mandatory. Today they are `Any | None` (report_b.py:1165–1176) so absence is silently tolerated.\n     b. No test asserts `reports/b/*` view builders have zero non-test callers — i.e. nothing detects the layer being dead.\n     c. No test asserts that `charts.js` in-module == root copy (item 2 gap).\n     d. No test asserts README/format-list consistency with `package-manifest.json.formats` (item 4 gap).\n     e. `tests/browser/*` exists and covers shell/autoescape/drawers, but there is no test asserting the v1.4 §11 four-viewport × two-engine matrix is *required* for acceptance (only that it can be recorded).\n\n8. 其他新发现 — see below.\n\n### 新发现\nF1 (P0). **The scientific view layer is dead code in production.** `build_efficacy_views`, `build_safety_views`, `build_matrix_view_state`, `build_endpoint_basis_set` have no callers in `src/` outside their own modules; the only callers are tests (e.g. tests/reports/b/test_efficacy_views.py:88, tests/reports/b/test_safety_heatmap.py:96, tests/reports/b/test_matrix_states.py:319). Meanwhile run_service.py:732 renders B via `build_report_b_artifact`, which never touches them. This is the single largest gap against v1.4 §9 line 183.\n\nF2 (P1). **`ReportBPortalData` has an untyped escape hatch.** report_b.py:1165–1176 declares `efficacy_views: Any | None`, `safety_views: Any | None`, `views: Mapping[str, Any] | None`, `view_states: Mapping[str, Any] | None`, `matrix_view(s)`. The project's stated技术形态 is \"Pydantic + 应用自有类型化控制图\" (v1.4 §4.1). These five `Any` fields are the exact seam where the science layer would connect; while they are `Any`, any drift in the view-set schema is undetectable at the boundary.\n\nF3 (P1). **`reports/b/__init__.py` is missing** while `reports/a/__init__.py`, `reports/c/__init__.py`, `reports/common/__init__.py` exist. `ci_workflow.reports.b` is an implicit namespace package. Effect: `uv_build` packaging of a namespace dir is tool-dependent, and the module is the scientific core of the product. Low cost to fix, and it is a prerequisite for making the layer importable as a unit.\n\nF4 (P1). **Source routes are declared but unexecutable, and the gate accepts the declaration.** `domain/research_package.py:1019–1031` accepts `route.result_class in {\"completed\",\"success_with_evidence\",\"not_applicable\",\"access_blocked\",...}`. Note `not_applicable` is accepted without any applicability evidence at this gate — v1.4 §6.1 (line 131 region) and §9 require \"不可访问不是不适用\" / \"明确不适用与未知是不同状态，必须有适用性依据\". The research package gate therefore has a one-token path to a green closure with zero acquisition. `sources/policy.py:36` defines `SourceApplicability.NOT_APPLICABLE` but the gate does not consult it.\n\nF5 (P2). **`tools/gate.sh` has no scientific step, and the layer audit it does run guards the wrong axis.** test_v1_test_layering.py enforces HTML-only format layering (LEGACY_RUNTIME_IMPORTS, RETAINED_FILES) — valuable — but there is no equivalent contract for \"renderer must not adjudicate\". Adding one is the cheapest structural guard available.\n\nF6 (P2). **`README.md` still advertises the excluded formats and a stale phase.** README.md:3 lists 原生 PDF、HTML-PPT、可编辑 PPTX as outputs; README.md:5 says \"当前状态：Phase 0 基线建设\". This is a user-facing file inside the install bundle (DEFAULT_ALLOWLIST line 362 includes README.md, and FINAL_REQUIRED_CONTENT line 406 requires it). So the shipped bundle's own README contradicts `package-manifest.json` `formats: [\"html\"]` and v1.4 §1.2.\n\nF7 (P2). **`ctgov_fetch` is the only acquisition path and it self-declares non-closure, yet the CLI exposes it as a product command.** `cli.py:487–540` + package-manifest.json:125 `research fetch-ctgov`. Combined with F4, a user-visible command can produce a receipt that satisfies the closure gate. This is not a code bug — it is an acceptance-integrity risk: the receipt's own limitation string (cli.py:528) is the only thing standing between a single-query fetch and a \"closed\" universe claim.\n\nF8 (P3). `assets/portal/manifest.json` lists 6 files but the in-module assets dir has 13; `report-{a,b,c}.{js,css}` are unmanifested and untested (only referenced by their renderers). If any of them is ever loaded through `resolve_portal_asset`, it has no fallback and no digest pin.\n\nF9 (P3, positive finding). The latest-pointer implementation is genuinely fail-closed and worth preserving as a model: `application/latest_delivery.py` refuses rollback (84–88), uses BEGIN IMMEDIATE + compare-and-swap (90–95), re-verifies the artifact manifest (96), fsync + os.replace (97–103), and `read_latest_delivery` re-validates the pointer against the accepted-artifact list (58–64) rather than trusting the label. v1.4 §12 line 235 asks exactly this. No action needed.\n\nF10 (P3). `renderers/pdf`, `pdf_native`, `html_ppt`, `pptx_master` and `qc/pdf.py` remain in the working tree (correct per v1.4 §1.2 \"代码留开发仓\") and are correctly excluded from the bundle by `tools/bundle_contract.py:100–119` (`_V1_DEFERRED_PATHS`) with fail-closed `_assert_not_deferred` (131–133). Positive finding — no action. But note the exclusion is by path prefix; any new deferred module added under an allowed prefix (e.g. `src/ci_workflow/application/`) must be added to the set manually, so the set is a maintenance point.\n\n### 建议的下一步\n5-10 minimal verifiable actions, dependency-ordered.\n\n1. Add the missing negative contract for asset drift (F2/item 2): extend tests/browser/test_portal_shell.py's byte-equality assertion to charts.js (and assert manifest sha256 against the **in-module** copy). ~20 lines, no src change.\n2. Add the \"renderer must not adjudicate\" contract test (F5): assert that a B run payload lacking `efficacy_views`/`safety_views` fails closed. This will fail today — which is the point: it converts item 1 from an opinion into a red test.\n3. Fix the authority index (item 4): one contract test that asserts README.md's format list == package-manifest.json `formats`, and that only one spec file claims authority. Then correct README.md to HTML-only and remove the stale \"Phase 0\" line.\n4. Add `src/ci_workflow/reports/b/__init__.py` (F3) and make `ReportBPortalData.efficacy_views`/`safety_views` typed (`EfficacyViewSet | None` / `SafetyViewSet | None`) instead of `Any` (F2). Typing first, required-ness second — typing alone will surface schema drift immediately.\n5. Add a `review_receipt_id` + explicit status transition to `SemanticGroupingProposal`, and reuse `SemanticAdjudicationReceipt`'s existing `model_id`/`independent_review_id`/`independent_context` shape rather than inventing a second receipt type (item 5, step 1).\n6. Add `capabilities/semantic_review.py` as the producer, wired to the graph's `semantic-review` node (v1.4 §4.1 line 66) — one function that turns a fact set into proposals, with the deterministic `compare_clinical_constructs` guard retained as veto (item 5, step 2).\n7. Add a PubMed fetch path reusing the existing `build_pubmed_nct_search_url` (pubmed.py:104) + `parse_pubmed_efetch_xml` (pubmed.py:125), with a CLI handler mirroring `_research_fetch_ctgov_handler` and a synthetic-transport test (item 6, step 1). This is the cheapest way to prove the route mechanism actually executes rather than being declared.\n8. Tighten the research-package gate (F4): require applicability evidence for `not_applicable` route results, so a single-query CT.gov receipt cannot close a universe. Small, high-leverage, and independent of 5–7.\n9. Only after 5–8 are green: run the PNH vertical slice end-to-end as the first true acceptance (fixtures already exist at fixtures/positive/b-pnh), then decide the 8×3 rollout.\n10. Defer P7 source-set convergence and any commit until 9 passes; meanwhile produce a hashed inventory of the current dirty tree so recovery is measurable (item 3).\n\nNow, the 结论 section: three sentences.\n\nLet me write it. I should keep it dense but complete. The user asked for strict output format. Let me follow it exactly.\n\nOne more consideration: I should be honest about what I could not verify (bash denied → no git status count, no byte-level hashing). I'll note that inline.\n\nLet me write the final answer.\n\nAlso, note the user asked me to verify \"是否成立\" for each. Let me use 成立 / 不成立 / 部分成立.\n\nLet me now write it out.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a08c8052637ef99d54eb1364f5e9f1","_messageId":"01a08c8424f4758cbbbbedce7580f202","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a08c8052637ef99d54eb1364f5e9f1","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a08c8424f4758cbbbbedce7580f202","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a08c8424f4758cbbbbedce7580f202","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a08c84-24f4-758c-bbbb-edd079095c23","traceparent":"00-a4b4af999c08dd6458b96ec034bb4fe0-e2f7c4948accacf5-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a08c80-51fc-7e4d-8c44-75c5d8fe8dd6,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a08c8052637ef99d54eb1364f5e9f1"},"__timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:12:02.309Z"}
{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a08c84-24f4-758c-bbbb-edcfc6513321","session_id":"01a08c80-51fc-7e4d-8c44-75c5d8fe8dd6","message":{"id":"01a08c8424f4758cbbbbedce7580f202","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Trellis SessionStart ✓\n\n已按只读边界完成评审。说明：本会话 Bash 被拒（非交互模式无审批通道），因此所有行数用 `Grep -c` 精确取得，字节级哈希无法计算；凡未经我实测的数字均标注来源。旧中文工程零接触。\n\n---\n\n## 结论\n\n引擎骨架（domain/gates/graph/storage/application，共 115,247 行 / 192 个 py 文件）是真实、失败关闭的工程，但**产品的科学内核是双份的**：`reports/b/*` 约 12,000 行的科学视图层只有测试在调用，真正出 HTML 的 `renderers/portal/report_b.py` 自己重算了一遍裁决逻辑——这是\"完整医学语义\"目标的真正阻塞点。最大三个风险：**① 权威科学视图层未接线（P0）；② 除 CT.gov 单条件查询外零真实取数，24 门户矩阵无通往真实的路径（P0）；③ 1,220 条未提交改动且无已验证里程碑，恢复成本不可测（P1）**。优先行动顺序：先补\"渲染器不得自行裁决\"的红测与类型化接缝（1→2），再补一条可执行真实路线与 `not_applicable` 适用性证据（7→8），最后才接通语义提案链并跑 PNH 竖向验收（5→6→9）——**在此之前不做 source-set 收敛、不做任何提交**。\n\n---\n\n## 清单逐条裁决\n\n### 1. 巨型文件 / 科学-渲染耦合 — **部分成立，且比清单描述更严重**\n\n行数全部精确核实：`report_b.py` 4199、`run_service.py` 3938、`reports/b/pages.py` 3757、`safety.py` 3333、`efficacy.py` 3316。\n\n清单说\"renderer 内仍持有裁决逻辑\"，这是对的，但**真正的问题不是文件大，而是权威层没人用**：\n\n- `renderers/portal/report_b.py:310` 起是自带的临床别名表 `_CLINICAL_CONCEPT_GROUPS`（310–744），另有 `_canonical_arm_role`(:815)、`_canonical_statistical_form`(:771)、`_time_band`(:835)、`_semantic_group_key`(:2771)、`_cross_trial_groups`(:2861)、`_groups_for_page`(:2961)。这些确实是医学裁决，不是排版。\n- 但 `reports/b/efficacy.py:build_efficacy_views`(:2938)、`safety.py:build_safety_views`(:3060)、`pages.py:build_matrix_view_state`(:3537)、`efficacy.py:build_endpoint_basis_set`(:1443) 在 `src/` 内**除自身模块外零调用者**；唯一调用者是测试（`tests/reports/b/test_efficacy_views.py:88`、`test_safety_heatmap.py:96`、`test_matrix_states.py:319`）。\n- 出报告的唯一路径是 `run_service.py:732` → `build_report_b_artifact`，它从不触碰上述视图层。\n- 更关键：`report_b.py:2748` 的 `_project_scientific_groups` 拿 `semantic_row_digest` 校验\"页面观察属于完整科学视图\"，看起来是正向约束——但 `scientific_groups` 本身来自 `report_b.py:3690` 的 `_groups_for_page(...)`，**是渲染器自己产出的**。这是渲染器对自己做一致性校验（循环），不是对科学视图层的一致性校验。\n\n**修正意见**：拆分不是第一步。把一个持有科学层副本的 4,199 行文件切开，只会让同一套规则出现第三个家，之后更难删。最小安全路径是四步，顺序不可换：\n\n1. 把 `ReportBPortalData` 的 `efficacy_views/safety_views`（`report_b.py:1165–1176`，当前是 `Any | None`）改成类型化字段；\n2. 让 `_groups_for_page` 消费 `EfficacyViewSet`/`SafetyViewSet`，删掉本地 `_semantic_group_key` 的初分桶；\n3. 让 `_project_scientific_groups` 的 `groups` 来源改为科学层而非 `3690` 行；\n4. **此后**才按域拆文件，且拆出来的语义助手归 `reports/b`，不是留在 `renderers/`。\n\n### 2. 双份资产手动同步 — **部分成立，风险方向被清单说反了**\n\n- 重复的 5 个文件：`charts.js`、`portal.css`、`portal.js`、`evidence-drawer.js`、`evidence-drawer.css`。我用行数+首尾行采样比对，5 份当前一致（未做 SHA，Bash 被拒）；仓库内的护栏做的是 SHA。\n- 护栏覆盖**不全**：`tests/browser/test_portal_shell.py:455–479` 只覆盖 `portal.css`/`portal.js`（+ logo 的 brand↔module），`tests/browser/test_evidence_drawer.py:192–205` 只覆盖 `evidence-drawer.js/css`。**`charts.js`（63,109 字节 / 1,822 行）没有 portal↔module 字节相等测试**，它只被 `cli.py:_verify_asset_manifests`(:163–185) 用 `manifest.json` 的 sha 校验——而那校验的是 **repo 根副本**，运行期消费的却是**模块内副本**（`builder.py:144–170`，module-first）。\n- `report-a/b/c.js/css` 只存在于模块内，不在任何 allow-list、不在 manifest.json、task44 fixture（`tests/fixtures/task44-chart-table-sync/render_fixture.py:188–203`）还故意混用两处来源。\n\n**修正意见**：不要引入\"构建期复制\"。安装包是**源码 allowlist**（`tools/bundle_contract.py:360–398`，第 382 行含 `src/ci_workflow/renderers/portal`），模块内副本才是发货副本。正确收敛是：保留模块内为唯一运行来源，把根 `assets/portal/` 降级为**被校验的镜像**——把已有的字节相等测试扩到全部 5 个文件（约 20 行），或直接删掉根副本、让 `cli.py` 对模块内字节校验 manifest。加构建步骤只会新增一个失败模式、零收益。\n\n### 3. 大规模脏树 — **成立**\n\n- HEAD 已核实：`.git/refs/heads/main` = `bb27ec9d750cf02fb64da5dfe665b2f4b262922d`，与清单一致。脏树条目数我无法实测（Bash 被拒）；会话环境自报 1,220 条，作为参考而非我的实测结论。\n- 已有机制齐备且够用：`tools/check_clean_tree.py`（失败关闭、支持精确路径豁免）、`tools/verify_rebaseline_source_set.py`、`tools/rebaseline_snapshot.py`、`tools/gate.sh --require-clean/--source-set`（gate.sh:108–114）。\n- v5 P7 第 1 条要求的\"受控 source-set 逐文件纳入、保全原脏树\"，**机制已经存在**，不需要新造。\n\n**修正意见（与清单的疑问直接相关）**：**不要做中间里程碑提交。** 理由不是\"禁止推测性历史提交\"这条纪律，而是实质性的：当前树的科学链已知未接线（第 1 条）、真实取数只有单查询（第 6 条），此时提交会把一个**未验证的科学身份**固化成 provenance 锚点；v1.4 §14（第 255 行）要求身份同时绑定代码+证据+页面，而这三者现在都还不成立。事后验收要么继承一个假锚点，要么公开否弃它。\n\n降恢复成本改用不落 git 的方式：立刻产出一份**脏树内容寻址清单**（路径 + sha256 + 字节数，不 stage），使任何丢失可被检出、且可用现有脚本重生成。若用户坚持要检查点，唯一安全形式是**仓库外的 tar 归档 + 哈希**，不是 commit。\n\n### 4. 导航 / 元数据漂移 — **成立，且是\"三处权威互相矛盾\"，比清单更严重**\n\n- `docs/specs/README.md:3`：**\"当前唯一批准的完整产品设计是 `...-v1.3.md`（2026-09-04）\"**；:7 称 v1.3 为 canonical。\n- `docs/specs/competitive-intelligence-workflow-design-v1.4-review.md:1` 标题\"完整设计 v1.4（待审定）\"；:3 明确\"本文件不代表Goal已设置，也不是实现完成或发布声明\"；:38\"本文中的新技术设计是审定候选，不冒称用户逐条批准\"。\n- 项目 `AGENTS.md` 仍写 v1.3 是 approved product contract。\n- `README.md:3` 仍在宣传四种输出（站点式 HTML、原生 PDF、HTML-PPT、可编辑 PPTX），`:5` 还写\"当前状态：Phase 0 基线建设\"——与 v1.4 §1.2（第 23 行，首版仅 HTML）和 `package-manifest.json:11`（`formats: [\"html\"]`）直接冲突。\n\n**修正意见**：注意——**不能据此把 v1.4 升为权威**，它自己声明未审定。正确做法是让权威索引**机器可检**：`docs/specs/README.md` 保留为唯一索引，加一条合同测试断言\"只有一个 spec 文件声明权威\"且\"README 的格式清单 == `package-manifest.json.formats`\"。`tests/contract/test_approved_spec_hash.py` 已存在，扩它，不要新建机制。然后修正 `README.md` 为 HTML-only 并删掉 Phase 0 那一行。\n\n### 5. 语义提案链未闭环 — **成立；但清单对 P3.2 的判断有误**\n\n- `SemanticGroupingProposal`（`reports/b/semantic_grouping.py:34–61`）的 `status: Literal[\"proposal\"]` **在 schema 层面就无法表示\"已批准\"**，也没有任何 review/issuer 字段。测试还把这个当特性验证（`tests/reports/b/test_semantic_grouping_proposals.py:97` 用 `model_copy(update={\"status\":\"accepted\"})` 期望抛错）。\n- 生产者：`src/` 内不存在。唯一构造点是测试（同文件 :31–36，`producer_id=\"synthetic-model\"`）。\n- 消费者：`report_b.py:2883` `proposed_semantic_buckets(...)`，渲染器是唯一消费者。\n- `review_issuer.py:330` `issue_review_receipt` 与 `scientific_review_transition.py:646` `promote_rendered_candidate` 作用于**整个已渲染门户**（回执绑定 `ScientificQcCurrentContext`），**不作用于提案**。没有任何函数做 proposal 的 candidate→approved 迁移。\n- 已有正确形状但无人生产：`SemanticAdjudicationReceipt`（`reports/b/semantic_contract.py:106–118`）带 `model_id`/`independent_review_id`/`independent_context`，grep 显示仅在本文件内被引用。\n\n**对清单的修正**：P3.2「版本化时间政策未实现」**不成立**。`TimepointCompatibilityPolicy`（`reports/b/contracts.py:619`，含 `version` + `policy_id` + `_time_policy_id_text`）与 `EndpointCompatibilityPolicy`（:497）确实存在，从 YAML 加载（:791–804），并且**已被疗效视图层消费**（`efficacy.py:895–914`、`1254/1279`、`1443/1457`）。缺口不是政策，而是**渲染器的 `_time_band`（`report_b.py:835`）自己做单位换算、从不读该政策**——又一次双份。\n\nP3.1 完整临床单元：**确实缺失**，`clinical_unit` 在 `src/` 内零命中。\nP3.3–P3.5：**部分**。`unknown` 是哨兵字符串 `\"not_reported\"`（`semantic_contract.py:77–86`）+ `semantic_value_is_unknown`；`SourceApplicability.NOT_APPLICABLE`（`sources/policy.py:36`）与 `RouteCompletionState.NOT_APPLICABLE`（`sources/planner.py:15`）只存在于**路线层**，临床事实层没有 `not_applicable`。\"不适用≠未知\"在路线层被强制，在观察层没有。\n\n**最小接通路径与顺序**（顺序不可换）：\n\n1. 给 `SemanticGroupingProposal` 加显式状态迁移 + `review_receipt_id`，并**复用** `SemanticAdjudicationReceipt` 的既有字段形状，不要造第二种回执类型；\n2. 新增生产者 `capabilities/semantic_review.py`，接到图的 `semantic-review` 节点（v1.4 §4.1 第 66 行），确定性 `compare_clinical_constructs` 保留为否决；\n3. 让签发路径给提案签回执（复用 `review_issuer` 的身份/上下文绑定）；\n4. 最后才让 `_groups_for_page` 消费已批准提案。\n\n**不要从 P3.1 开始**——它是更大的数据模型改动，且它的缺失并不阻塞 1–4。\n\n### 6. P2 来源链缺口 — **成立，且比清单更严重**\n\n- 全仓**唯一**网络实现：`sources/connectors/ctgov_fetch.py:62–77`（`urllib.request` + 禁跳转 opener）。\n- 查询形状**只有一种**：`query.cond=<condition>`（`ctgov_fetch.py:125–127`）。无 by-sponsor / by-intervention / by-NCT / by-target。\n- 其余五个连接器全部是**纯校验/URL 构造，无网络代码**：`clinicaltrials_gov.py`(353) 记录构造器+分页 URL；`pubmed.py`(300) 仅 URL 构造(:104) + XML 解析(:125)；`regulators.py`(348)、`company.py`(168)、`china_registries.py`(672)、`authoritative_wechat.py`(248) 全为校验。\n- **必需路线被声明但无执行器**：`policies/sources/source-policy-v1.yaml` 标了 `clinicaltrials_gov` required_global_baseline、`cde`/`chinadrugtrials`/`dxy_drug_assistant` required_for_china；但 `sources/planner.py` 是状态机模型类（`RouteProgress`、`assess_historical_source`），**不是 planner**。真正的强制点在 `domain/research_package.py:1019–1031`，而它只检查 `closure.global_route_ids`/`china_route_ids` 里记录的 `result_class` 是否落在允许集合内——**它不执行路线**。\n- 时间：`ctgov_fetch.py:93–94` 硬编码 `universe_closed: Literal[False]`、`temporal_scope: Literal[\"current_records\"]`；`cli.py:528` 自写限制串。\n- OCR：`src/` 内零命中。浏览器适配：不存在，`application/yaozh_access.py`(439) 只持久化\"是否有访问权\"。\n- 无任何产物证明真实端到端：CT.gov 测试全部用合成 transport（`tests/integration/sources/test_ctgov_fetch.py:23–33`）；各适应症 fixture 全是随包 JSON（如 `fixtures/positive/b-pnh/inputs/report-data.json`）。\n\n**对清单的修正**：\"竖向样例优先还是横向铺开优先\"这个二选一是错的。在语义链未接线的前提下，竖向样例**无法验收**（它需要尚不存在的独立科学复核路径）；而横向铺开等于把一条未验证的管线复制 24 份，产出 24 份没人能科学接受的产物。正确顺序：**① 先补一条真实可执行路线**（PubMed 最便宜：`pubmed.py:104`+`:125` 已有 URL 构造与 XML 解析，只缺一次 fetch+parse 调用和一个仿 `_research_fetch_ctgov_handler` 的 CLI handler）；**② 闭合提案链（第 5 条）**；**③ 再跑一个 PNH 竖向端到端作为首次真实验收**；**④ 最后才铺 8×3**。\n\n### 7. 测试体系 — **部分成立**\n\n- 规模核实：`tests/**/test_*.py` 约 250 个，分布在 12–13 个顶层根（acceptance / application / browser / contract / graph / hosts / html_ppt / integration / migration / pdf / renderers / reports / unit）。\n- \"gate 是 quality-only\"**成立且是明示设计**：`tools/gate.sh:101–106` 只跑 ruff / mypy / v1-fast-tests(tests/unit+tests/contract) / retained-compat-smoke / v1-layer-audit / legacy-references，`:123` 自报 `GATE_OK status=quality-only`。科学门、真实浏览器门、包装/三宿主门、恢复门、RC 门都不在其中——v1.4 §14（第 251 行）要求它们**分别留证、不互相替代**，所以这不是疏漏。但它意味着\"gate 全绿\"对产品零含义，且现有的分层审计（`tests/contract/test_v1_test_layering.py`）只守**格式分层**，不守科学分层。\n- 对\"页面=科学视图投影\"的覆盖：形状对、但**循环**。`_project_scientific_groups`（`report_b.py:2748–2768`）确实用 `semantic_row_digest` 拒绝页面行与完整视图不一致——但\"完整视图\"由 `report_b.py:3690` 自己产出。它证明的是渲染器自洽，不是与 `reports/b` 一致。\n\n**缺失的关键负向合同**（每条都便宜、可立即补）：\n\n- **a.** 没有测试断言渲染器不得自行裁决。最强可执行形式：断言 B 运行在缺少 `efficacy_views`/`safety_views` 时**失败关闭**。今天这两个字段是 `Any | None`（`report_b.py:1165–1176`），缺失被静默容忍。\n- **b.** 没有测试能发现 `reports/b/*` 的视图构造器是死代码。\n- **c.** 没有测试断言 `charts.js` 两处副本一致（第 2 条缺口）。\n- **d.** 没有测试断言 README 格式清单与 `package-manifest.json.formats` 一致（第 4 条缺口）。\n- **e.** `tests/browser/*` 覆盖了 shell/autoescape/drawer，但没有测试断言 v1.4 §11（第 219 行）的四视口 × 双引擎矩阵是**验收必要条件**，只证明了它可以被记录。\n\n---\n\n## 新发现\n\n**F1（P0）科学视图层在生产路径上是死代码。** `build_efficacy_views`/`build_safety_views`/`build_matrix_view_state`/`build_endpoint_basis_set` 在 `src/` 内无外部调用者，只有测试调用（`tests/reports/b/test_efficacy_views.py:88`、`test_safety_heatmap.py:96`、`test_matrix_states.py:319`）；而 `run_service.py:732` 走的 `build_report_b_artifact` 从不触碰它们。这是对 v1.4 §9（第 183 行）最大的偏离，也是第 1 条的真实内核。\n\n**F2（P1）`ReportBPortalData` 有未类型化逃生口。** `report_b.py:1165–1176` 的 `efficacy_views: Any | None`、`safety_views: Any | None`、`views`/`view_states: Mapping[str, Any] | None`、`matrix_view(s)` 五个 `Any` 字段，正是科学层本该接入的接缝。产品合同的技术形态是\"Pydantic + 应用自有类型化控制图\"（v1.4 §4.1 第 54 行），而这些 `Any` 使视图集 schema 漂移在边界上完全不可检。\n\n**F3（P1）`src/ci_workflow/reports/b/__init__.py` 缺失**，而 `reports/a`、`reports/c`、`reports/common` 都有。`ci_workflow.reports.b` 是隐式命名空间包——这恰好是产品科学内核所在模块，且是把它作为整体导入/打包的前提。修复成本极低。\n\n**F4（P1）路线结果 `not_applicable` 在闭包门被无证据接受。** `domain/research_package.py:1019–1031` 的允许集合包含 `\"not_applicable\"`，但该处**不要求任何适用性依据**。`sources/policy.py:36` 定义了 `SourceApplicability.NOT_APPLICABLE`，门却不查它。后果：一个\"不适用\"字符串即可让闭包门变绿，与 v1.4 §6.1/§9（\"不可访问不是不适用\"、\"明确不适用与未知是不同状态，必须有适用性依据\"）直接冲突。\n\n**F5（P2）缺少科学分层的合同审计。** `test_v1_test_layering.py` 守的是 HTML-only 格式分层（`LEGACY_RUNTIME_IMPORTS`、`RETAINED_FILES`），很有价值；但没有等价的\"渲染器不得裁决\"合同。这是当前可得的最便宜的结构性护栏。\n\n**F6（P2）`README.md` 是发货文件，却宣传被排除的格式。** `README.md:3` 列出原生 PDF/HTML-PPT/可编辑 PPTX，`:5` 写\"Phase 0 基线建设\"；而 `README.md` 同时被 `tools/bundle_contract.py:362`（allowlist）和 `:406`（`FINAL_REQUIRED_CONTENT`）要求进包。即**发货包自带的 README 与 `package-manifest.json:11` 和 v1.4 §1.2 冲突**。\n\n**F7（P2）单查询取数可满足闭包门的验收完整性风险。** `cli.py:487–540` + `package-manifest.json:125` 暴露 `research fetch-ctgov` 为用户可见命令；结合 F4，一次 `query.cond` 查询的回执有路径满足闭包门，唯一的拦截是回执自带的限制串（`cli.py:528`）。这不是代码 bug，是验收完整性风险。\n\n**F8（P3）模块内 13 个资产里 6 个未被 manifest 覆盖。** `assets/portal/manifest.json` 只列 6 个文件；`report-{a,b,c}.{js,css}` 仅存在于模块内，无 allow-list、无 digest 固定。一旦它们被 `resolve_portal_asset` 加载，既无 repo 回退也无摘要校验。\n\n**F9（P3，正向发现）latest 指针实现是失败关闭的，可作为范式保留。** `application/latest_delivery.py`：拒绝回退与同时刻覆盖（:84–88）、`BEGIN IMMEDIATE` + compare-and-swap（:90–95）、发布前重验产物清单（:96）、fsync + `os.replace`（:97–103），且 `read_latest_delivery` 是**重开已接受链校验**而非信任标签（:58–64）。这正是 v1.4 §12（第 235 行）要求的。无需动作。\n\n**F10（P3）延后能力的 bundle 排除是对的，但是人工维护点。** `renderers/pdf`、`pdf_native`、`html_ppt`、`pptx_master`、`qc/pdf.py` 留在开发仓（符合 v1.4 §1.2\"代码留开发仓\"），并由 `tools/bundle_contract.py:100–119` 的 `_V1_DEFERRED_PATHS` + `_assert_not_deferred`(:131–133) 失败关闭地排除。正向发现，无需动作。但排除是**按路径前缀**做的，任何新增在已允许前缀下（例如 `src/ci_workflow/application/`）的延后模块必须手工加入该集合——这是个维护点。\n\n---\n\n## 建议的下一步\n\n按依赖顺序，每条都是最小可验收单元：\n\n1. **补齐资产漂移护栏**：把 `tests/browser/test_portal_shell.py:455–479` 的字节相等断言扩到 `charts.js`，并把 manifest sha 校验对象从 repo 根副本改为**模块内副本**（第 2 条 / F8 的一半）。约 20 行，不动 `src/`。\n2. **补\"渲染器不得裁决\"的负向合同**：断言 B 运行在缺少 `efficacy_views`/`safety_views` 时失败关闭（第 7a 条 / F5）。**这条现在会红——这正是目的**：把第 1 条从意见变成红灯。\n3. **统一权威索引**：加一条合同测试，断言 `README.md` 格式清单 == `package-manifest.json.formats`，且只有一个 spec 文件声明权威；随后把 `README.md` 改为 HTML-only、删除 Phase 0 行（第 4 条 / F6）。扩 `test_approved_spec_hash.py`，不新建机制。\n4. **补 `reports/b/__init__.py`，并把 `efficacy_views`/`safety_views` 从 `Any` 改为类型化字段**（F3 / F2）。先类型化、后强制必填——仅类型化就会立刻暴露 schema 漂移。\n5. **给 `SemanticGroupingProposal` 加显式状态迁移 + `review_receipt_id`**，复用 `SemanticAdjudicationReceipt` 既有字段形状（第 5 条步骤 1）。\n6. **新增 `capabilities/semantic_review.py` 作为生产者**，接到图的 `semantic-review` 节点（v1.4 §4.1 第 66 行），保留 `compare_clinical_constructs` 为确定性否决（第 5 条步骤 2）。\n7. **补一条真实可执行的 PubMed 路线**，复用 `pubmed.py:104` 的 URL 构造与 `:125` 的 XML 解析，加一个仿 `_research_fetch_ctgov_handler` 的 CLI handler 与合成 transport 测试（第 6 条步骤 1）。这是证明\"路线机制真会执行、而非只是被声明\"的最便宜方式。\n8. **收紧闭包门**：`not_applicable` 的路线结果必须附适用性依据（F4）。改动小、杠杆高，且与 5–7 相互独立。\n9. **只有 5–8 全绿后**，才跑 PNH 竖向端到端作为首次真实验收（fixture 已存在于 `fixtures/positive/b-pnh`），再决定 8×3 铺开节奏（第 6 条步骤 3–4）。\n10. **在 9 通过前，推迟 P7 source-set 收敛与任何提交**；期间只产出一份脏树内容寻址清单（路径 + sha256 + 字节数，不 stage），使恢复成本可测量（第 3 条）。\n\n**未验证项声明**：脏树条目数（1,220）来自会话环境自报，非我实测；两处资产副本的一致性为行数+首尾采样结论，非字节哈希；`tests/**/test_*.py` 计数为约 250（Glob 全量枚举），非精确到个位。以上三项不影响任何裁决的方向性结论。"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":143730,"output_tokens":13085,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7666,"cache_read_input_tokens":136064,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a08c8052637ef99d54eb1364f5e9f1","_messageId":"01a08c8424f4758cbbbbedce7580f202","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a08c8052637ef99d54eb1364f5e9f1","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a08c8424f4758cbbbbedce7580f202","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a08c8424f4758cbbbbedce7580f202","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a08c84-24f4-758c-bbbb-edcfc6513321","traceparent":"00-a4b4af999c08dd6458b96ec034bb4fe0-e2f7c4948accacf5-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a08c80-51fc-7e4d-8c44-75c5d8fe8dd6,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a08c8052637ef99d54eb1364f5e9f1"},"__timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:12:02.702Z"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"result":"Trellis SessionStart ✓\n\n已按只读边界完成评审。说明：本会话 Bash 被拒（非交互模式无审批通道），因此所有行数用 `Grep -c` 精确取得，字节级哈希无法计算；凡未经我实测的数字均标注来源。旧中文工程零接触。\n\n---\n\n## 结论\n\n引擎骨架（domain/gates/graph/storage/application，共 115,247 行 / 192 个 py 文件）是真实、失败关闭的工程，但**产品的科学内核是双份的**：`reports/b/*` 约 12,000 行的科学视图层只有测试在调用，真正出 HTML 的 `renderers/portal/report_b.py` 自己重算了一遍裁决逻辑——这是\"完整医学语义\"目标的真正阻塞点。最大三个风险：**① 权威科学视图层未接线（P0）；② 除 CT.gov 单条件查询外零真实取数，24 门户矩阵无通往真实的路径（P0）；③ 1,220 条未提交改动且无已验证里程碑，恢复成本不可测（P1）**。优先行动顺序：先补\"渲染器不得自行裁决\"的红测与类型化接缝（1→2），再补一条可执行真实路线与 `not_applicable` 适用性证据（7→8），最后才接通语义提案链并跑 PNH 竖向验收（5→6→9）——**在此之前不做 source-set 收敛、不做任何提交**。\n\n---\n\n## 清单逐条裁决\n\n### 1. 巨型文件 / 科学-渲染耦合 — **部分成立，且比清单描述更严重**\n\n行数全部精确核实：`report_b.py` 4199、`run_service.py` 3938、`reports/b/pages.py` 3757、`safety.py` 3333、`efficacy.py` 3316。\n\n清单说\"renderer 内仍持有裁决逻辑\"，这是对的，但**真正的问题不是文件大，而是权威层没人用**：\n\n- `renderers/portal/report_b.py:310` 起是自带的临床别名表 `_CLINICAL_CONCEPT_GROUPS`（310–744），另有 `_canonical_arm_role`(:815)、`_canonical_statistical_form`(:771)、`_time_band`(:835)、`_semantic_group_key`(:2771)、`_cross_trial_groups`(:2861)、`_groups_for_page`(:2961)。这些确实是医学裁决，不是排版。\n- 但 `reports/b/efficacy.py:build_efficacy_views`(:2938)、`safety.py:build_safety_views`(:3060)、`pages.py:build_matrix_view_state`(:3537)、`efficacy.py:build_endpoint_basis_set`(:1443) 在 `src/` 内**除自身模块外零调用者**；唯一调用者是测试（`tests/reports/b/test_efficacy_views.py:88`、`test_safety_heatmap.py:96`、`test_matrix_states.py:319`）。\n- 出报告的唯一路径是 `run_service.py:732` → `build_report_b_artifact`，它从不触碰上述视图层。\n- 更关键：`report_b.py:2748` 的 `_project_scientific_groups` 拿 `semantic_row_digest` 校验\"页面观察属于完整科学视图\"，看起来是正向约束——但 `scientific_groups` 本身来自 `report_b.py:3690` 的 `_groups_for_page(...)`，**是渲染器自己产出的**。这是渲染器对自己做一致性校验（循环），不是对科学视图层的一致性校验。\n\n**修正意见**：拆分不是第一步。把一个持有科学层副本的 4,199 行文件切开，只会让同一套规则出现第三个家，之后更难删。最小安全路径是四步，顺序不可换：\n\n1. 把 `ReportBPortalData` 的 `efficacy_views/safety_views`（`report_b.py:1165–1176`，当前是 `Any | None`）改成类型化字段；\n2. 让 `_groups_for_page` 消费 `EfficacyViewSet`/`SafetyViewSet`，删掉本地 `_semantic_group_key` 的初分桶；\n3. 让 `_project_scientific_groups` 的 `groups` 来源改为科学层而非 `3690` 行；\n4. **此后**才按域拆文件，且拆出来的语义助手归 `reports/b`，不是留在 `renderers/`。\n\n### 2. 双份资产手动同步 — **部分成立，风险方向被清单说反了**\n\n- 重复的 5 个文件：`charts.js`、`portal.css`、`portal.js`、`evidence-drawer.js`、`evidence-drawer.css`。我用行数+首尾行采样比对，5 份当前一致（未做 SHA，Bash 被拒）；仓库内的护栏做的是 SHA。\n- 护栏覆盖**不全**：`tests/browser/test_portal_shell.py:455–479` 只覆盖 `portal.css`/`portal.js`（+ logo 的 brand↔module），`tests/browser/test_evidence_drawer.py:192–205` 只覆盖 `evidence-drawer.js/css`。**`charts.js`（63,109 字节 / 1,822 行）没有 portal↔module 字节相等测试**，它只被 `cli.py:_verify_asset_manifests`(:163–185) 用 `manifest.json` 的 sha 校验——而那校验的是 **repo 根副本**，运行期消费的却是**模块内副本**（`builder.py:144–170`，module-first）。\n- `report-a/b/c.js/css` 只存在于模块内，不在任何 allow-list、不在 manifest.json、task44 fixture（`tests/fixtures/task44-chart-table-sync/render_fixture.py:188–203`）还故意混用两处来源。\n\n**修正意见**：不要引入\"构建期复制\"。安装包是**源码 allowlist**（`tools/bundle_contract.py:360–398`，第 382 行含 `src/ci_workflow/renderers/portal`），模块内副本才是发货副本。正确收敛是：保留模块内为唯一运行来源，把根 `assets/portal/` 降级为**被校验的镜像**——把已有的字节相等测试扩到全部 5 个文件（约 20 行），或直接删掉根副本、让 `cli.py` 对模块内字节校验 manifest。加构建步骤只会新增一个失败模式、零收益。\n\n### 3. 大规模脏树 — **成立**\n\n- HEAD 已核实：`.git/refs/heads/main` = `bb27ec9d750cf02fb64da5dfe665b2f4b262922d`，与清单一致。脏树条目数我无法实测（Bash 被拒）；会话环境自报 1,220 条，作为参考而非我的实测结论。\n- 已有机制齐备且够用：`tools/check_clean_tree.py`（失败关闭、支持精确路径豁免）、`tools/verify_rebaseline_source_set.py`、`tools/rebaseline_snapshot.py`、`tools/gate.sh --require-clean/--source-set`（gate.sh:108–114）。\n- v5 P7 第 1 条要求的\"受控 source-set 逐文件纳入、保全原脏树\"，**机制已经存在**，不需要新造。\n\n**修正意见（与清单的疑问直接相关）**：**不要做中间里程碑提交。** 理由不是\"禁止推测性历史提交\"这条纪律，而是实质性的：当前树的科学链已知未接线（第 1 条）、真实取数只有单查询（第 6 条），此时提交会把一个**未验证的科学身份**固化成 provenance 锚点；v1.4 §14（第 255 行）要求身份同时绑定代码+证据+页面，而这三者现在都还不成立。事后验收要么继承一个假锚点，要么公开否弃它。\n\n降恢复成本改用不落 git 的方式：立刻产出一份**脏树内容寻址清单**（路径 + sha256 + 字节数，不 stage），使任何丢失可被检出、且可用现有脚本重生成。若用户坚持要检查点，唯一安全形式是**仓库外的 tar 归档 + 哈希**，不是 commit。\n\n### 4. 导航 / 元数据漂移 — **成立，且是\"三处权威互相矛盾\"，比清单更严重**\n\n- `docs/specs/README.md:3`：**\"当前唯一批准的完整产品设计是 `...-v1.3.md`（2026-09-04）\"**；:7 称 v1.3 为 canonical。\n- `docs/specs/competitive-intelligence-workflow-design-v1.4-review.md:1` 标题\"完整设计 v1.4（待审定）\"；:3 明确\"本文件不代表Goal已设置，也不是实现完成或发布声明\"；:38\"本文中的新技术设计是审定候选，不冒称用户逐条批准\"。\n- 项目 `AGENTS.md` 仍写 v1.3 是 approved product contract。\n- `README.md:3` 仍在宣传四种输出（站点式 HTML、原生 PDF、HTML-PPT、可编辑 PPTX），`:5` 还写\"当前状态：Phase 0 基线建设\"——与 v1.4 §1.2（第 23 行，首版仅 HTML）和 `package-manifest.json:11`（`formats: [\"html\"]`）直接冲突。\n\n**修正意见**：注意——**不能据此把 v1.4 升为权威**，它自己声明未审定。正确做法是让权威索引**机器可检**：`docs/specs/README.md` 保留为唯一索引，加一条合同测试断言\"只有一个 spec 文件声明权威\"且\"README 的格式清单 == `package-manifest.json.formats`\"。`tests/contract/test_approved_spec_hash.py` 已存在，扩它，不要新建机制。然后修正 `README.md` 为 HTML-only 并删掉 Phase 0 那一行。\n\n### 5. 语义提案链未闭环 — **成立；但清单对 P3.2 的判断有误**\n\n- `SemanticGroupingProposal`（`reports/b/semantic_grouping.py:34–61`）的 `status: Literal[\"proposal\"]` **在 schema 层面就无法表示\"已批准\"**，也没有任何 review/issuer 字段。测试还把这个当特性验证（`tests/reports/b/test_semantic_grouping_proposals.py:97` 用 `model_copy(update={\"status\":\"accepted\"})` 期望抛错）。\n- 生产者：`src/` 内不存在。唯一构造点是测试（同文件 :31–36，`producer_id=\"synthetic-model\"`）。\n- 消费者：`report_b.py:2883` `proposed_semantic_buckets(...)`，渲染器是唯一消费者。\n- `review_issuer.py:330` `issue_review_receipt` 与 `scientific_review_transition.py:646` `promote_rendered_candidate` 作用于**整个已渲染门户**（回执绑定 `ScientificQcCurrentContext`），**不作用于提案**。没有任何函数做 proposal 的 candidate→approved 迁移。\n- 已有正确形状但无人生产：`SemanticAdjudicationReceipt`（`reports/b/semantic_contract.py:106–118`）带 `model_id`/`independent_review_id`/`independent_context`，grep 显示仅在本文件内被引用。\n\n**对清单的修正**：P3.2「版本化时间政策未实现」**不成立**。`TimepointCompatibilityPolicy`（`reports/b/contracts.py:619`，含 `version` + `policy_id` + `_time_policy_id_text`）与 `EndpointCompatibilityPolicy`（:497）确实存在，从 YAML 加载（:791–804），并且**已被疗效视图层消费**（`efficacy.py:895–914`、`1254/1279`、`1443/1457`）。缺口不是政策，而是**渲染器的 `_time_band`（`report_b.py:835`）自己做单位换算、从不读该政策**——又一次双份。\n\nP3.1 完整临床单元：**确实缺失**，`clinical_unit` 在 `src/` 内零命中。\nP3.3–P3.5：**部分**。`unknown` 是哨兵字符串 `\"not_reported\"`（`semantic_contract.py:77–86`）+ `semantic_value_is_unknown`；`SourceApplicability.NOT_APPLICABLE`（`sources/policy.py:36`）与 `RouteCompletionState.NOT_APPLICABLE`（`sources/planner.py:15`）只存在于**路线层**，临床事实层没有 `not_applicable`。\"不适用≠未知\"在路线层被强制，在观察层没有。\n\n**最小接通路径与顺序**（顺序不可换）：\n\n1. 给 `SemanticGroupingProposal` 加显式状态迁移 + `review_receipt_id`，并**复用** `SemanticAdjudicationReceipt` 的既有字段形状，不要造第二种回执类型；\n2. 新增生产者 `capabilities/semantic_review.py`，接到图的 `semantic-review` 节点（v1.4 §4.1 第 66 行），确定性 `compare_clinical_constructs` 保留为否决；\n3. 让签发路径给提案签回执（复用 `review_issuer` 的身份/上下文绑定）；\n4. 最后才让 `_groups_for_page` 消费已批准提案。\n\n**不要从 P3.1 开始**——它是更大的数据模型改动，且它的缺失并不阻塞 1–4。\n\n### 6. P2 来源链缺口 — **成立，且比清单更严重**\n\n- 全仓**唯一**网络实现：`sources/connectors/ctgov_fetch.py:62–77`（`urllib.request` + 禁跳转 opener）。\n- 查询形状**只有一种**：`query.cond=<condition>`（`ctgov_fetch.py:125–127`）。无 by-sponsor / by-intervention / by-NCT / by-target。\n- 其余五个连接器全部是**纯校验/URL 构造，无网络代码**：`clinicaltrials_gov.py`(353) 记录构造器+分页 URL；`pubmed.py`(300) 仅 URL 构造(:104) + XML 解析(:125)；`regulators.py`(348)、`company.py`(168)、`china_registries.py`(672)、`authoritative_wechat.py`(248) 全为校验。\n- **必需路线被声明但无执行器**：`policies/sources/source-policy-v1.yaml` 标了 `clinicaltrials_gov` required_global_baseline、`cde`/`chinadrugtrials`/`dxy_drug_assistant` required_for_china；但 `sources/planner.py` 是状态机模型类（`RouteProgress`、`assess_historical_source`），**不是 planner**。真正的强制点在 `domain/research_package.py:1019–1031`，而它只检查 `closure.global_route_ids`/`china_route_ids` 里记录的 `result_class` 是否落在允许集合内——**它不执行路线**。\n- 时间：`ctgov_fetch.py:93–94` 硬编码 `universe_closed: Literal[False]`、`temporal_scope: Literal[\"current_records\"]`；`cli.py:528` 自写限制串。\n- OCR：`src/` 内零命中。浏览器适配：不存在，`application/yaozh_access.py`(439) 只持久化\"是否有访问权\"。\n- 无任何产物证明真实端到端：CT.gov 测试全部用合成 transport（`tests/integration/sources/test_ctgov_fetch.py:23–33`）；各适应症 fixture 全是随包 JSON（如 `fixtures/positive/b-pnh/inputs/report-data.json`）。\n\n**对清单的修正**：\"竖向样例优先还是横向铺开优先\"这个二选一是错的。在语义链未接线的前提下，竖向样例**无法验收**（它需要尚不存在的独立科学复核路径）；而横向铺开等于把一条未验证的管线复制 24 份，产出 24 份没人能科学接受的产物。正确顺序：**① 先补一条真实可执行路线**（PubMed 最便宜：`pubmed.py:104`+`:125` 已有 URL 构造与 XML 解析，只缺一次 fetch+parse 调用和一个仿 `_research_fetch_ctgov_handler` 的 CLI handler）；**② 闭合提案链（第 5 条）**；**③ 再跑一个 PNH 竖向端到端作为首次真实验收**；**④ 最后才铺 8×3**。\n\n### 7. 测试体系 — **部分成立**\n\n- 规模核实：`tests/**/test_*.py` 约 250 个，分布在 12–13 个顶层根（acceptance / application / browser / contract / graph / hosts / html_ppt / integration / migration / pdf / renderers / reports / unit）。\n- \"gate 是 quality-only\"**成立且是明示设计**：`tools/gate.sh:101–106` 只跑 ruff / mypy / v1-fast-tests(tests/unit+tests/contract) / retained-compat-smoke / v1-layer-audit / legacy-references，`:123` 自报 `GATE_OK status=quality-only`。科学门、真实浏览器门、包装/三宿主门、恢复门、RC 门都不在其中——v1.4 §14（第 251 行）要求它们**分别留证、不互相替代**，所以这不是疏漏。但它意味着\"gate 全绿\"对产品零含义，且现有的分层审计（`tests/contract/test_v1_test_layering.py`）只守**格式分层**，不守科学分层。\n- 对\"页面=科学视图投影\"的覆盖：形状对、但**循环**。`_project_scientific_groups`（`report_b.py:2748–2768`）确实用 `semantic_row_digest` 拒绝页面行与完整视图不一致——但\"完整视图\"由 `report_b.py:3690` 自己产出。它证明的是渲染器自洽，不是与 `reports/b` 一致。\n\n**缺失的关键负向合同**（每条都便宜、可立即补）：\n\n- **a.** 没有测试断言渲染器不得自行裁决。最强可执行形式：断言 B 运行在缺少 `efficacy_views`/`safety_views` 时**失败关闭**。今天这两个字段是 `Any | None`（`report_b.py:1165–1176`），缺失被静默容忍。\n- **b.** 没有测试能发现 `reports/b/*` 的视图构造器是死代码。\n- **c.** 没有测试断言 `charts.js` 两处副本一致（第 2 条缺口）。\n- **d.** 没有测试断言 README 格式清单与 `package-manifest.json.formats` 一致（第 4 条缺口）。\n- **e.** `tests/browser/*` 覆盖了 shell/autoescape/drawer，但没有测试断言 v1.4 §11（第 219 行）的四视口 × 双引擎矩阵是**验收必要条件**，只证明了它可以被记录。\n\n---\n\n## 新发现\n\n**F1（P0）科学视图层在生产路径上是死代码。** `build_efficacy_views`/`build_safety_views`/`build_matrix_view_state`/`build_endpoint_basis_set` 在 `src/` 内无外部调用者，只有测试调用（`tests/reports/b/test_efficacy_views.py:88`、`test_safety_heatmap.py:96`、`test_matrix_states.py:319`）；而 `run_service.py:732` 走的 `build_report_b_artifact` 从不触碰它们。这是对 v1.4 §9（第 183 行）最大的偏离，也是第 1 条的真实内核。\n\n**F2（P1）`ReportBPortalData` 有未类型化逃生口。** `report_b.py:1165–1176` 的 `efficacy_views: Any | None`、`safety_views: Any | None`、`views`/`view_states: Mapping[str, Any] | None`、`matrix_view(s)` 五个 `Any` 字段，正是科学层本该接入的接缝。产品合同的技术形态是\"Pydantic + 应用自有类型化控制图\"（v1.4 §4.1 第 54 行），而这些 `Any` 使视图集 schema 漂移在边界上完全不可检。\n\n**F3（P1）`src/ci_workflow/reports/b/__init__.py` 缺失**，而 `reports/a`、`reports/c`、`reports/common` 都有。`ci_workflow.reports.b` 是隐式命名空间包——这恰好是产品科学内核所在模块，且是把它作为整体导入/打包的前提。修复成本极低。\n\n**F4（P1）路线结果 `not_applicable` 在闭包门被无证据接受。** `domain/research_package.py:1019–1031` 的允许集合包含 `\"not_applicable\"`，但该处**不要求任何适用性依据**。`sources/policy.py:36` 定义了 `SourceApplicability.NOT_APPLICABLE`，门却不查它。后果：一个\"不适用\"字符串即可让闭包门变绿，与 v1.4 §6.1/§9（\"不可访问不是不适用\"、\"明确不适用与未知是不同状态，必须有适用性依据\"）直接冲突。\n\n**F5（P2）缺少科学分层的合同审计。** `test_v1_test_layering.py` 守的是 HTML-only 格式分层（`LEGACY_RUNTIME_IMPORTS`、`RETAINED_FILES`），很有价值；但没有等价的\"渲染器不得裁决\"合同。这是当前可得的最便宜的结构性护栏。\n\n**F6（P2）`README.md` 是发货文件，却宣传被排除的格式。** `README.md:3` 列出原生 PDF/HTML-PPT/可编辑 PPTX，`:5` 写\"Phase 0 基线建设\"；而 `README.md` 同时被 `tools/bundle_contract.py:362`（allowlist）和 `:406`（`FINAL_REQUIRED_CONTENT`）要求进包。即**发货包自带的 README 与 `package-manifest.json:11` 和 v1.4 §1.2 冲突**。\n\n**F7（P2）单查询取数可满足闭包门的验收完整性风险。** `cli.py:487–540` + `package-manifest.json:125` 暴露 `research fetch-ctgov` 为用户可见命令；结合 F4，一次 `query.cond` 查询的回执有路径满足闭包门，唯一的拦截是回执自带的限制串（`cli.py:528`）。这不是代码 bug，是验收完整性风险。\n\n**F8（P3）模块内 13 个资产里 6 个未被 manifest 覆盖。** `assets/portal/manifest.json` 只列 6 个文件；`report-{a,b,c}.{js,css}` 仅存在于模块内，无 allow-list、无 digest 固定。一旦它们被 `resolve_portal_asset` 加载，既无 repo 回退也无摘要校验。\n\n**F9（P3，正向发现）latest 指针实现是失败关闭的，可作为范式保留。** `application/latest_delivery.py`：拒绝回退与同时刻覆盖（:84–88）、`BEGIN IMMEDIATE` + compare-and-swap（:90–95）、发布前重验产物清单（:96）、fsync + `os.replace`（:97–103），且 `read_latest_delivery` 是**重开已接受链校验**而非信任标签（:58–64）。这正是 v1.4 §12（第 235 行）要求的。无需动作。\n\n**F10（P3）延后能力的 bundle 排除是对的，但是人工维护点。** `renderers/pdf`、`pdf_native`、`html_ppt`、`pptx_master`、`qc/pdf.py` 留在开发仓（符合 v1.4 §1.2\"代码留开发仓\"），并由 `tools/bundle_contract.py:100–119` 的 `_V1_DEFERRED_PATHS` + `_assert_not_deferred`(:131–133) 失败关闭地排除。正向发现，无需动作。但排除是**按路径前缀**做的，任何新增在已允许前缀下（例如 `src/ci_workflow/application/`）的延后模块必须手工加入该集合——这是个维护点。\n\n---\n\n## 建议的下一步\n\n按依赖顺序，每条都是最小可验收单元：\n\n1. **补齐资产漂移护栏**：把 `tests/browser/test_portal_shell.py:455–479` 的字节相等断言扩到 `charts.js`，并把 manifest sha 校验对象从 repo 根副本改为**模块内副本**（第 2 条 / F8 的一半）。约 20 行，不动 `src/`。\n2. **补\"渲染器不得裁决\"的负向合同**：断言 B 运行在缺少 `efficacy_views`/`safety_views` 时失败关闭（第 7a 条 / F5）。**这条现在会红——这正是目的**：把第 1 条从意见变成红灯。\n3. **统一权威索引**：加一条合同测试，断言 `README.md` 格式清单 == `package-manifest.json.formats`，且只有一个 spec 文件声明权威；随后把 `README.md` 改为 HTML-only、删除 Phase 0 行（第 4 条 / F6）。扩 `test_approved_spec_hash.py`，不新建机制。\n4. **补 `reports/b/__init__.py`，并把 `efficacy_views`/`safety_views` 从 `Any` 改为类型化字段**（F3 / F2）。先类型化、后强制必填——仅类型化就会立刻暴露 schema 漂移。\n5. **给 `SemanticGroupingProposal` 加显式状态迁移 + `review_receipt_id`**，复用 `SemanticAdjudicationReceipt` 既有字段形状（第 5 条步骤 1）。\n6. **新增 `capabilities/semantic_review.py` 作为生产者**，接到图的 `semantic-review` 节点（v1.4 §4.1 第 66 行），保留 `compare_clinical_constructs` 为确定性否决（第 5 条步骤 2）。\n7. **补一条真实可执行的 PubMed 路线**，复用 `pubmed.py:104` 的 URL 构造与 `:125` 的 XML 解析，加一个仿 `_research_fetch_ctgov_handler` 的 CLI handler 与合成 transport 测试（第 6 条步骤 1）。这是证明\"路线机制真会执行、而非只是被声明\"的最便宜方式。\n8. **收紧闭包门**：`not_applicable` 的路线结果必须附适用性依据（F4）。改动小、杠杆高，且与 5–7 相互独立。\n9. **只有 5–8 全绿后**，才跑 PNH 竖向端到端作为首次真实验收（fixture 已存在于 `fixtures/positive/b-pnh`），再决定 8×3 铺开节奏（第 6 条步骤 3–4）。\n10. **在 9 通过前，推迟 P7 source-set 收敛与任何提交**；期间只产出一份脏树内容寻址清单（路径 + sha256 + 字节数，不 stage），使恢复成本可测量（第 3 条）。\n\n**未验证项声明**：脏树条目数（1,220）来自会话环境自报，非我实测；两处资产副本的一致性为行数+首尾采样结论，非字节哈希；`tests/**/test_*.py` 计数为约 250（Glob 全量枚举），非精确到个位。以上三项不影响任何裁决的方向性结论。","uuid":"01a08c85-0410-711f-8bc0-8be6b78b0e01","session_id":"01a08c80-51fc-7e4d-8c44-75c5d8fe8dd6","duration_ms":304697,"duration_api_ms":440154,"num_turns":172,"total_cost_usd":0,"usage":{"input_tokens":6717577,"output_tokens":76403,"cache_creation_input_tokens":125848,"cache_read_input_tokens":2164096,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null},"permission_denials":[],"modelUsage":{"minimax-m3":{"inputTokens":0,"outputTokens":34082,"cacheReadInputTokens":593771,"cacheCreationInputTokens":209589,"contextWindow":512000,"maxOutputTokens":128000},"deepseek-v4-flash":{"inputTokens":0,"outputTokens":29537,"cacheReadInputTokens":2164096,"cacheCreationInputTokens":125848,"contextWindow":0,"maxOutputTokens":0}},"_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/contextUsed":143730,"codebuddy.ai/usageByCategory":{"systemPrompt":2969,"conversation":100863,"tools":38396,"mcp":142,"skills":1360,"version":1},"traceparent":"00-a4b4af999c08dd6458b96ec034bb4fe0-e2f7c4948accacf5-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a08c80-51fc-7e4d-8c44-75c5d8fe8dd6,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a08c8052637ef99d54eb1364f5e9f1"},"__timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:12:02.713Z","_requestId":"01a08c8052637ef99d54eb1364f5e9f1"}
